WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Counting birr

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:08.433
Today we are buying bread for the family. How many birr are in our pocket?

3
00:00:08.433 --> 00:00:10.667
Start with the biggest.

4
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:14.167
Two ten-birr notes are twenty birr.

5
00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:17.600
Add a five-birr note: twenty-five.

6
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.167
Add one birr: twenty-six birr.
